---
source: src/cli/insights/mod.rs
assertion: kTruss insight section exposes triangle-supported structural health using fnx_algorithms::k_truss
schema:
  structural_input: ee.insights.structural_graph.v1
  structural_report: ee.health.structural.v1
  output: ee.insights.v1
contracts:
  - k_truss computed from memory_links structural graph via fnx_algorithms::k_truss
  - items ordered by truss_level descending, then memoryId ascending
  - mainTrussMember is true when truss_level equals max_truss_level and max_truss_level >= 3
  - memberCountAtTrussLevel reflects the member distribution at the item's truss level
  - evidence.memberCounts is a map of k -> count for all k values found
  - honest empty section returned when no structural graph data is available
  - evidence includes algorithm=fnx_algorithms::k_truss, structuralGraphSchema, snapshotVersion, nodeCount, edgeCount
evidence:
  - KTrussInsightInput.memory_id
  - KTrussInsightInput.truss_level
  - KTrussInsightInput.max_truss_level
  - KTrussInsightInput.member_count_at_truss_level
  - KTrussInsightInput.degree
  - item.rank
  - item.memoryId
  - item.trussLevel
  - item.maxTrussLevel
  - item.degree
  - item.memberCountAtTrussLevel
  - item.mainTrussMember
  - item.interpretation
  - item.evidence.schema
  - item.evidence.algorithm
  - item.evidence.graphType
  - item.evidence.snapshotVersion
  - item.evidence.nodeCount
  - item.evidence.edgeCount
  - item.evidence.filterPosture
  - item.evidence.structuralGraphSchema
  - item.evidence.memberCounts
verified_by:
  - cargo test --lib k_truss_section_emits_structural_triangle_support_evidence -- --nocapture
  - cargo test --lib k_truss_section -- --nocapture
